; claude: the protocols of networking/ over real sockets: a TCP
; connection (Tcp), and an HTTP GET with its redirections
; (Http_client), which is what graphics/images/'s Download uses for
; http:// URLs. The operating system's side (Unix), so native only. A
; private library, installed as part of elm_playground_software, like
; graphics_images, its user (see playground/platforms/native_common/dune for why
; that package).
(library
 (name networking_unix)
 (package elm_playground_software)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries
   unix
   threads.posix ; Worker's pool
   caps ; Cap.network, which every function opening a socket takes
   networking ; Url, Http, and Smtp, Pop3, Mbox (Mail_server)
   random ; Lehmer, Relay_client's masks
 )
)
